[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0518","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0518.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45778","title":"GNU GRUB2 BFS文件系统解析器整数溢出漏洞","description":"GNU GRUB2 的 BFS 文件系统解析器存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190），当解析特制的 BFS 文件系统时，整数溢出导致栈上出现无限循环，最终引发栈溢出使 GRUB2 崩溃。攻击者需具备本地高权限访问，通过挂载恶意构造的 BFS 文件系统触发该漏洞，造成系统引导阶段拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 GRUB2 的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 4.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45778"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T17:15:12.700","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41.177","remediation":"升级 GRUB2 至包含修复的版本：Ubuntu 24.04 升级至 grub2-unsigned 2.12-1ubuntu7.3 及以上，Ubuntu 20.04/22.04 升级至 2.06-2ubuntu14.8 及以上；RHEL 系列等待厂商安全更新。如无法立即更新，限制仅受信任用户访问系统引导加载程序，避免加载恶意构造的 BFS 文件系统镜像。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45778","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2345640","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45778.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45778.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/d5bf3451a732b5296c5b8cc86dbcb9121c5ea07d/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45778.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45778","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45778.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45778.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-45778.json","https://github.com/seapath/meta-seapath/blob/479229566d9de44367de66249dba8ed29de7b8ff/recipes-bsp/grub/files/CVE-2024-45778_CVE-2024-45779.patch"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0518.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0520","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45780","title":"GNU GRUB2 tar文件解析整数溢出导致堆越界写入漏洞","description":"GNU GRUB2 的 tar 文件系统解析器在处理畸形 tar 文件时存在整数溢出漏洞。当读取 tar 文件时，GRUB2 为文件名分配内部缓冲区，但在分配长度计算过程中未正确校验整数溢出风险。攻击者可通过构造特制的 tar 文件触发分配长度溢出，导致堆越界写入。该漏洞允许具有本地高权限的攻击者绕过 Secure Boot 安全启动保护机制，在系统启动阶段执行任意代码，破坏系统完整性验证链。CVSS 评分 6.7，危害等级中等，影响使用 GRUB2 的多个 Linux 发行版。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45780"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T15:15:14.950","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41.443","remediation":"升级 GRUB2 至包含 commit 0087bc69 的版本（如 GRUB 2.12 以上或对应发行版补丁包）。对于 Red Hat 系发行版，安装 RHSA 安全更新；Debian/Ubuntu 运行 `apt update && apt upgrade grub-pc` 后执行 `update-grub`。无法立即升级时，启用 UEFI Secure Boot 并配置 shim 签名验证，限制本地攻击者加载自制 tar 归档的物理访问条件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45780","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2345856","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45780.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45780.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/b14f5555ae5b53d86b7353a1ef112eb3496498f9/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45780.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45780","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45780.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45780.md","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-xxc4-h4cm-j5r2/GHSA-xxc4-h4cm-j5r2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0519","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0519.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45779","title":"GNU GRUB2 BFS文件系统解析器整数溢出导致堆越界读取漏洞","description":"GNU GRUB2 的 BFS 文件系统驱动程序中存在整数溢出漏洞。当读取包含间接映射表的文件时，grub2 未能正确验证要读取的 extent 条目数量，导致在处理特制或损坏的 BFS 文件系统时发生整数溢出，进而引发堆越界读取。本地攻击者需要拥有高权限，通过挂载恶意构造的 BFS 文件系统触发该漏洞，可能导致敏感内存信息泄露或 GRUB2 崩溃。该漏洞影响所有使用 grub2 的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 6.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45779"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T15:15:14.660","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41.310","remediation":"升级 grub2 至修复版本（>2.12）。若厂商尚未发布正式更新包，可从 grub-devel 邮件列表（https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html）获取补丁自行编译安装。Red Hat/CentOS 用户关注 RHSA 安全公告，Ubuntu/Debian 用户通过 `apt update && apt upgrade grub-pc grub2-common` 安装更新。由于该漏洞需要本地高权限且无法远程利用，临时缓解措施可限制系统物理访问和本地用户登录权限，仅允许受信任用户执行 grub2 相关操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45779","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2345854","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45779.nopatch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45779.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/d5bf3451a732b5296c5b8cc86dbcb9121c5ea07d/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45779.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45779","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45779.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45779.md","https://github.com/seapath/meta-seapath/blob/479229566d9de44367de66249dba8ed29de7b8ff/recipes-bsp/grub/files/CVE-2024-45778_CVE-2024-45779.patch","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-45779.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0519.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0609","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57852","title":"Linux Kernel Qualcomm SCM 固件空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Qualcomm SCM（安全通道管理器）固件驱动中存在空指针解引用漏洞。由于 qcom_scm_get_tzmem_pool() 函数在 SCM 设备缺失时会返回 NULL，而调用者未正确检查返回值，导致在特定条件下对空指针进行解引用操作，引发内核崩溃。本地攻击者需具备低权限即可触发此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 Qualcomm 芯片的 Linux 内核系统，已在 Linux 内核主线中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57852"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:10.977","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:06.587","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.16、6.13.4 或 6.14 及以上版本。对于无法升级内核的系统，可手动 cherry-pick 补丁提交 cd955b75849b、57a811c0886f 或 94f48ecf0a53 到对应内核分支，在 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm-smc.c 中增加对 qcom_scm_get_tzmem_pool() 返回 NULL 的判空处理。临时缓解措施可禁用受影响设备上的 Qualcomm SCM 固件接口模块加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/57a811c0886f3f3677bb4619502b35b5bb917f2e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/94f48ecf0a538019ca2025e0b0da391f8e7cc58c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cd955b75849b58b650ca3f87b83bd78cde1da8bc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57852.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57852.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57852","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2024-57852.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57852.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57852.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57852-firmware-qcom-scm-smc-handle-missin-1771405501000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57852.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-232p-m442-j9m4/GHSA-232p-m442-j9m4.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2024-57852"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0605","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0605.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57834","title":"Linux kernel vidtv 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 media 子系统的 vidtv（虚拟数字电视）驱动中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当 vidtv_start_streaming() 中 dvb->mux 未通过 vidtv_mux_init() 成功初始化时，后续调用 vidtv_mux_stop_thread() 会访问空指针 mux，导致内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过构造特殊 DVB 设备操作序列触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57834"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:10.870","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:05.300","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至包含 commit 9b2ffa6148b1 的版本（主线 v6.13-rc4 及以上）。Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户升级至 linux-image-5.15.0-1083-gcp 或更新版本（USN-7511-1）；Debian 11 用户应用 DLA-4178 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可卸载或禁用 vidtv 内核模块（modprobe -r vidtv），该模块仅用于测试目的，非生产环境必需。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1221989555db711578a327a9367f1be46500cb48","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2c5601b99d79d196fe4a37159e3dfb38e778ea18","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/52d3512f9a7a52ef92864679b1e8e8aa16202c6a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/59a707ad952eb2ea8d59457d662b6f4138f17b08","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/86307e443c5844f38e1b98e2c51a4195c55576cd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/904a8323cc8afa7eb9ce3e67303a2b3f2f787306","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/95432a37778c9c5dd105b7b9f19e9695c9e166cf","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57834.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57834.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57834","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57834.yaml","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57834.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57834-2025-11-03-1334","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57834-media-vidtv-fix-a-null-ptr-deref-in-1771406209000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-xgjf-869w-4cgj/GHSA-xgjf-869w-4cgj.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2024/CVE-2024-57834.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57834"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0605.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0555","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0555.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-54458","title":"Linux kernel SCSI UFS BSG 模块释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 UFS 驱动的 bsg 子系统中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，在移除 bsg 设备后未将 bsg_queue 指针置为 NULL，导致后续对该已释放内存的访问可能触发 UAF。本地攻击者需具备低权限访问系统，利用此漏洞可实现权限提升，获取完全的内存读写能力，导致机密性、完整性和可用性均遭破坏。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，Red Hat 评估为低危，但 NVD 评分为 7.8（高危）。各 Linux 发行版已通过安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-54458"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:10.770","updated":"2026-07-14T13:17:12.847","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.10.237、5.15.181、6.1.129、6.6.79、6.12.16 或 6.13.4 及以上。Debian 11/12 用户安装 DLA-4178-1/DLA-4102-1 安全更新；SUSE 用户安装 SUSE-SU-2025:01951-1 等更新。Siemens SIMATIC S7-1500 MFP 用户升级固件至 V3.1.6 以上版本。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用受影响系统上的 UFS bsg 设备节点作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1e95c798d8a7f70965f0f88d4657b682ff0ec75f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/22018622e1e9e371198dbd983af946a844d5924c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5e7b6e44468c3242c21c2a8656d009fb3eb50a73","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5f782d4741bf558def60df192b858b0efc6a5f0a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/88a01e9c9ad40c075756ba93b47984461d4ff15d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9193bdc170cc23fe98aca71d1a63c0bf6e1e853b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bb4783c670180b922267222408e1c48d22dfbb46","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-54458.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/54xxx/CVE-2024-54458.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-54458.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-54458","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/54xxx/CVE-2024-54458.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-54458.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-54458.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-54458-2025-11-03-1359","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-54458-scsi-ufs-bsg-set-bsg-queue-to-null--1771405619000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ece131eb82ceb38a160571408bcbbb92bfa0f3c0/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-jc5w-m29h-g88w/GHSA-jc5w-m29h-g88w.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0555.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0549","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0549.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-52560","title":"Linux Kernel ntfs3 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 NTFS3 文件系统驱动中存在缺陷，当 mi_enum_attr() 函数在解析 NTFS 文件属性时检测到错误后，未能及时将 inode 标记为损坏状态，导致后续操作可能继续访问已损坏的 inode 结构，进而引发内核崩溃或系统挂起。本地低权限攻击者可通过挂载特制的恶意 NTFS 镜像文件触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 Linux 内核 NTFS3 驱动的系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-52560"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:10.573","updated":"2026-06-17T08:07:27.560","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至 6.13.4 或更高版本，或 cherry-pick 补丁提交 `d9c699f2c4dc174940ffe8600b20c267897da155`（主线）及 `2afd4d267e6dbaec8d3ccd4f5396cb84bc67aa2e`（稳定树）。如无法升级内核，可通过 `modprobe.blacklist=ntfs3` 内核参数禁用 ntfs3 驱动，改用稳定的 ntfs-3g 用户态驱动作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2afd4d267e6dbaec8d3ccd4f5396cb84bc67aa2e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d9c699f2c4dc174940ffe8600b20c267897da155","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-52560.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2024/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9d329f3fb4a036761a8cef4769f6255813453ca4/2024/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ad32beb8a6ecc99ff5b9401392fe4eb738c13e96/CVE-2024/CVE-2024-525xx/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/adb0abfbea757d46e846ba7d3640d43b01b979fe/tracker/CVE/2024/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-52560"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0549.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0548","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0548.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-52559","title":"Linux 内核 DRM/MSM/GEM 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Linux内核DRM MSM GEM子系统存在整数溢出漏洞。攻击者通过向目标系统提交特制的GEM命令控制`submit->cmd[i].size`和`submit->cmd[i].offset`等32位整数参数，在这些参数累加时可能触发整数溢出或绕溢bug。由于内核缺乏对这些用户可控参数的有效边界检查，攻击者可利用该漏洞在本地获取高级权限，最终执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有使用Linux内核MSM GPU驱动的系统，攻击者需具备局部执行权限，漏洞利用难度中等，CVSS评估评分5.5，属于中危等级，已在内核安全更新中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-52559"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:10.477","updated":"2026-06-17T08:07:27.397","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至包含补丁 https://patchwork.freedesktop.org/patch/624696/ 的版本（该补丁已合入主线内核）。Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户请升级至 linux-image-5.15.0-132-generic 或更新版本；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请升级至 linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic 或更新版本（参考 USN-7703-1）。如无法立即升级内核，可暂时禁用 MSM DRM 驱动（黑名单 msm 模块）作为临时缓解措施，但会导致高通 Adreno GPU 功能不可用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2b99b2c4621d13bd4374ef384e8f1fc188d0a5df","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2f1845e46c41ed500789d53dc45b383b7745c96c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3a47f4b439beb98e955d501c609dfd12b7836d61","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e43a0f1327a1ee70754f8a0de6e0262cfa3e0b87","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-52559.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52559.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-52559.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52559.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-52559","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-52559.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-86f7-x66f-vfwc/GHSA-86f7-x66f-vfwc.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-52559.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-52559","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-52559.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0548.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0553","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0553.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-53427","title":"jq 栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"jq 命令行 JSON 处理工具 1.7.1 及之前版本的 decNumber.c 中的 decNumberCopy 函数存在类型混淆漏洞（CWE-843），未正确区分 NaN（非数值）与普通数值类型，导致栈缓冲区溢出和越界写入。攻击者可通过构造包含特定 NaN 数字字符串（如 \"1 NaN123\" 后跟大量数字）的 JSON 输入，配合 --slurp 参数使用减法过滤器（如 .-.）触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务或潜在的信息泄露。该漏洞需本地访问且利用复杂度较高，CVSS 评分 8.1，影响所有使用 jq 1.7.1 及之前版本的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-53427"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T16:15:16.237","updated":"2026-06-17T08:08:52.940","remediation":"立即将 jq 升级至 1.8.0 及以上版本（当前最新为 1.8.2），该版本已合入拒绝解析带载荷 NaN（如 NaN123）的修复补丁。可通过包管理器更新（如 apt install jq=1.8.2、brew upgrade jq）或从 https://github.com/jqlang/jq/releases 下载最新二进制替换。如无法升级，可在输入 JSON 前通过预处理过滤包含 NaN 后跟数字的字符串作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gist.github.com/Ekkosun/a83870ce7f3b7813b9b462a395e8ad92","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/blob/71c2ab509a8628dbbad4bc7b3f98a64aa90d3297/src/decNumber/decNumber.c#L3375","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/issues/3196","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/issues/3296","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/security/advisories/GHSA-x6c3-qv5r-7q22","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-53427.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/53xxx/CVE-2024-53427.json","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/blob/2d410d6d86be7f685ad28e5cffac0248aa47664c/NEWS.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-53427.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-53427","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/53xxx/CVE-2024-53427.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/6ca8a69233790aa99633b6ad5606668ac000cf96/main/jq/APKBUILD","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-oe/recipes-devtools/jq/jq/CVE-2024-53427.patch","https://github.com/hashicorp/hcp/blob/22914bf04188992bd99f6dea82da226d9204f62b/.release/security-scan.hcl","https://github.com/wolfi-dev/os/blob/4b5161978d759ef78f9196705942bfe3008611db/jq.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0553.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0517","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0517.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45777","title":"GNU GRUB2 gettext 整数溢出导致堆越界写入漏洞","description":"GRUB2 的 gettext 国际化模块在处理语言 .mo 文件时存在整数溢出漏洞。函数 grub_gettext_getstr_from_position() 在计算翻译缓冲区大小时未正确校验，导致整数溢出后分配过小的堆缓冲区，进而引发堆越界写入。具有高权限的本地攻击者可通过挂载包含特制 .mo 语言文件的文件系统，在系统启动过程中触发该漏洞，覆盖 GRUB2 堆中的敏感数据，最终绕过 Secure Boot 安全启动保护机制。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响的 GRUB2 版本的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 6.7，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45777"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-19T18:15:23.210","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41.050","remediation":"立即将 grub2 升级至包含该修复的版本（上游 commit b970a5ed967816bbca8225994cd0ee2557bad515）。各发行版对应：Red Hat 系安装 RHSA 安全更新，Debian/Ubuntu 运行 `apt update && apt upgrade grub-pc grub-efi`，更新后执行 `update-grub` 并重启。如无法立即升级，可限制仅受信任用户拥有物理访问权限和 root 权限以缓解利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:20532","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45777","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2346343","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45777.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45777.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/e8893979ed5a1de12f167238f69085e8e620c963/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45777.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45777","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45777.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45777.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-45777.json","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-45777.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0517.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0597","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0597.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57259","title":"DENX Das U-Boot Squashfs 目录列表越界写入漏洞","description":"Das U-Boot 中的 sqfs_search_dir 函数存在差一错误（off-by-one）漏洞，由于在计算 squashfs 目录列表大小时未考虑路径分隔符，导致堆内存损坏。物理接触目标设备的攻击者可通过构造特制的 squashfs 镜像文件系统，在系统启动过程中触发该漏洞，可能导致拒绝服务或潜在的内存数据破坏。该漏洞影响 2025.01-rc1 之前的所有 Das U-Boot 版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57259"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T23:15:09.980","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:28.453","remediation":"升级 U-Boot 至 2025.01-rc1 及以上版本（上游 commit 048d795bb5b3d9c5701b4855f5e74bcf6849bf5e）。Debian 用户：bullseye 升级至 2021.01+dfsg-5+deb11u3，bookworm 升级至 2023.01+dfsg-2+deb12u3。如无法升级，在 squashfs 文件系统挂载前禁用 squashfs 目录遍历功能，或避免使用 squashfs 格式的启动镜像。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/048d795bb5b3d9c5701b4855f5e74bcf6849bf5e","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57259.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57259.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57259.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-57259","https://github.com/Xilinx/poky/blob/1d54d1c4736a114e1cecbe85a0306e3814d5ce70/meta/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57259.patch","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57259.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57259-2025-11-03-1351","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-57259.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57259-sqfs-search-dir-in-das-u-boot-befor-1771411984000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-c2cp-78ww-6jm8/GHSA-c2cp-78ww-6jm8.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0597.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0596","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0596.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57258","title":"DENX Das U-Boot 内存分配整数溢出漏洞","description":"Das U-Boot 引导加载程序在 2025.01-rc1 之前版本中存在整数溢出漏洞，源于对精心构造的 squashfs 文件系统进行内存分配时，通过 sbrk、request2size 或 x86_64 架构上 ptrdiff_t 处理不当触发。攻击者需物理接触目标设备并挂载恶意 squashfs 镜像，利用该漏洞可导致内存越界写入，进而实现任意代码执行或系统崩溃。该漏洞影响广泛使用 U-Boot 的嵌入式设备、物联网终端及开发板，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。厂商已在 2025.01-rc1 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57258"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T23:15:09.893","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:28.313","remediation":"升级 Das U-Boot 到 2025.01-rc1 或更高版本。Debian 11 用户请安装 DLA-4150 安全更新（`apt install u-boot`），SUSE Linux 用户请安装 SUSE-SU-2025:0989-1 更新。如无法立即升级，避免加载来源不可信的 squashfs 文件系统镜像，并限制物理访问以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/0a10b49206a29b4aa2f80233a3e53ca0466bb0b3","https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/8642b2178d2c4002c99a0b69a845a48f2ae2706f","https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/c17b2a05dd50a3ba437e6373093a0d6a359cdee0","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00001.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-577017.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57258.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57258.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-57258","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57258.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57258.json","https://github.com/ocp-hm-openbmc-opf-ami/meta-ami/blob/5f689b55d58747fe911d565fdb321768aed35a0b/meta-common/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57258.patch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57258-2025-11-03-1351","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57258.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57258.html","https://github.com/moyamartin/meta-rpi-mmoya/blob/503560d3dcf3bf87d8e93ed59f202e9120db397b/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57258-1.patch"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0596.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0595","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0595.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57257","title":"DENX Das U-Boot squashfs 文件系统栈消耗拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Das U-Boot 的 SquashFS 文件系统实现中的 sqfs_size 函数存在栈消耗漏洞（CWE-674），由于在处理符号链接时未限制递归深度，攻击者可通过向目标设备加载包含深度嵌套符号链接的恶意 SquashFS 文件系统镜像，触发无限递归导致栈溢出，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞需要物理接触目标设备才能利用，影响 U-Boot 2025.01-rc1 之前的所有版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57257"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T23:15:09.800","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:28.190","remediation":"升级 U-Boot 至 2025.01 或更高版本（该漏洞在 2025.01-rc1 之前存在）。Debian 11 用户请执行 `apt-get update && apt-get upgrade u-boot` 安装 DLA-4150-1 安全更新。若无法升级，可在加载 squashfs 文件系统前校验其来源可信性，避免加载包含深层符号链接嵌套的恶意 squashfs 镜像。嵌入式设备用户应同步更新厂商提供的 U-Boot 补丁包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/4f5cc096bfd0a591f8a11e86999e3d90a9484c34","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57257.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57257.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57257.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-57257","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57257.json","https://github.com/Xilinx/poky/blob/1d54d1c4736a114e1cecbe85a0306e3814d5ce70/meta/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57257.patch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57257-2025-11-03-1351","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57257-a-stack-consumption-issue-in-sqfs-s-1771412242000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-8h8c-f86r-pf3c/GHSA-8h8c-f86r-pf3c.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-57257"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0595.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0594","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0594.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57256","title":"Das U-Boot 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Das U-Boot 在 2025.01-rc1 之前的版本中存在整数溢出漏洞，具体位于 ext4fs_read_symlink 函数。当处理 ext4 文件系统符号链接时，函数对一个 le32 变量执行加一操作（zalloc 分配）时发生整数溢出，导致 malloc 分配零字节内存，进而引发内存覆写。攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 inode 大小（0xffffffff）的 ext4 文件系统镜像，使设备在引导过程中触发该漏洞，实现任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 U-Boot 引导加载程序的嵌入式设备和开发板，CVSS 评分 7.1（高危），攻击需物理接触或本地访问。修复方案为升级至 U-Boot 2025.01-rc1 或更高版本，厂商已提供补丁修复此整数溢出问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57256"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T23:15:09.710","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:28.053","remediation":"立即升级 Das U-Boot 至 2025.01-rc1 或更高稳定版本（建议 2025.01 正式发布版）。编译升级流程：从 U-Boot 官方仓库（https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot）克隆代码，切换至 v2025.01 标签，执行 `make <板型>_defconfig && make` 编译后刷写固件。若无法立即升级，可从上游获取 CVE-2024-57256 补丁（https://github.com/ocp-hm-openbmc-opf-ami/meta-ami 已收录该补丁文件），应用 `ext4fs_read_symlink` 函数中的 zalloc 大小校验修复，对 le32 变量加 1 前检查是否溢出。同时，限制设备从不可信 USB 存储设备启动，避免挂载来源不明的 ext4 分区，降低触发整数溢出的攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/35f75d2a46e5859138c83a75cd2f4141c5479ab9","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00001.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-577017.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57256.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57256.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-57256","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57256.json","https://github.com/ocp-hm-openbmc-opf-ami/meta-ami/blob/5f689b55d58747fe911d565fdb321768aed35a0b/meta-common/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57256.patch","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57256.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57256-2025-11-03-1351","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57256.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57256.html","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57256-an-integer-overflow-in-ext4fs-read--1771412947000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0594.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0593","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0593.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57255","title":"Das U-Boot SquashFS 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Das U-Boot 的 squashfs 文件系统解析函数 sqfs_resolve_symlink 中存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190）。当攻击者构造一个 inode 大小为 0xffffffff 的恶意 squashfs 镜像时，整数溢出导致 malloc(0) 分配零字节内存，进而引发内存越界写入，可能造成代码执行。该漏洞影响 Das U-Boot 2025.01-rc1 之前的所有版本，需物理接触或已获得系统访问权限的攻击者挂载特制 squashfs 文件系统触发，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57255"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T23:15:09.620","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:27.937","remediation":"立即将 Das U-Boot 升级至 v2025.01-rc1 及以上版本（上游修复 commit: 233945eba63e）。Debian 用户：Bullseye 升级至 2021.01+dfsg-5+deb11u3，Bookworm 升级至 2023.01+dfsg-2+deb12u3，Trixie/Sid 升级至 2025.01-3 及以上。如无法升级，避免加载或挂载来源不可信的 squashfs 镜像文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/233945eba63e24061dffeeaeb7cd6fe985278356","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57255.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57255.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57255.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-57255","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57255.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57255-2025-11-03-1351","https://github.com/moyamartin/meta-rpi-mmoya/blob/503560d3dcf3bf87d8e93ed59f202e9120db397b/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57255.patch","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57255.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57255-an-integer-overflow-in-sqfs-resolve-1771411771000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-5cmq-wrwp-9x26/GHSA-5cmq-wrwp-9x26.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":f